{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國加利福尼亞州選民正式否決了一項備受爭議的億萬富豪財富税提案。當地時間11月9日，美聯社確認，編號為第40號提案（Proposition 40）的財富税計劃未能獲得通過。這項原本希望向加州最富有居民徵收一次性5%財富税、為醫療保障體系籌集資金的計劃，最終在激烈的政治和商業遊說中宣告失敗。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585706.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.152582+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:49:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"fbfb951b6cb2e3faee626bd31c95919fa9f459f4739f1c80f96d08364d8889a1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}